# 1. Project Identity

## Project Name
discord-stock-assistant

## Core Vision
Build a Discord-based Korean stock portfolio assistant for Korean retail investors.

Users upload brokerage screenshots → OCR extracts holdings → portfolio changes tracked → personalized insights, alerts, journaling support.

## Target Users

- Korean retail investors
- Long-term investors tracking positions
- Users who want simple portfolio automation
- Discord community / investing group members

---

# 2. Product Core Flow

text
User uploads screenshot
→ OCR reads holdings
→ Match stock names / tickers
→ Save snapshot
→ Compare with previous snapshot
→ Detect buy/sell/add/reduce
→ Generate summary
→ Send Discord response / alerts
→ Store journal history
