7. Database Architecture (Completed Through Phase 4)
Phase 1 — Core Identity Layer
users
Purpose:

One row per Discord user / customer.

Fields (expected):

id
discord_user_id
username
created_at
updated_at
Use Cases:

identify owner of portfolios

preferences

alert ownership

stocks_master
Purpose:

Master table of Korean listed stocks.

Fields:

id
ticker
stock_name_kr
market_type
is_active
updated_at
Use Cases:

canonical stock reference

ticker lookup

stock_aliases
Purpose:

OCR text often messy. Alias table maps noisy names.

Examples:

삼성전자우
삼전
Samsung Elec
→ 삼성전자

Fields:

id
stock_id
alias_name
created_at
Use Cases:

OCR correction

fuzzy matching

Phase 2 — Snapshot / OCR Layer
portfolio_snapshots
Purpose:

One upload = one portfolio state.

Fields:

id
user_id
uploaded_at
source_type
image_path(optional)
total_value(optional)
notes
Use Cases:

historical portfolio states

compare snapshots

holdings
Purpose:

Detailed holdings belonging to a snapshot.

Fields:

id
snapshot_id
stock_id
quantity
avg_price(optional)
market_price(optional)
weight(optional)
Use Cases:

calculate allocation

compare changes

ocr_unmatched
Purpose:

When OCR text cannot map to stock.

Fields:

id
snapshot_id
raw_text
reason
resolved_flag
created_at
Use Cases:

improve alias table

monitor OCR quality

Phase 3 — Insight / Activity Layer
portfolio_changes
Purpose:

Store differences between two snapshots.

Examples:

Bought 10 Samsung
Sold 5 SK Hynix
Added position in NAVER
Exited Kakao
Fields:

id
user_id
old_snapshot_id
new_snapshot_id
change_type
stock_id
old_qty
new_qty
delta_qty
created_at
Use Cases:

auto summaries

notifications

journal_entries
Purpose:

Investment diary linked to events.

Fields:

id
user_id
snapshot_id(optional)
title
content
mood(optional)
created_at
Use Cases:

reflection log

why user bought/sold

alerts
Purpose:

User-facing notifications.

Examples:

Rebalancing drift high
Large concentration risk
OCR failed
Snapshot processed
Fields:

id
user_id
alert_type
message
is_read
created_at
Use Cases:

Discord DM / channel alerts

Phase 4 — User Settings / Operations Layer
user_preferences
Purpose:

Store personalization settings.

Fields:

id
user_id
language
timezone
alert_enabled
risk_profile(optional)
summary_style(optional)
updated_at
Use Cases:

custom responses

scheduling

upload_logs
Purpose:

Operational logging of uploads.

Fields:

id
user_id
snapshot_id(optional)
filename
status
error_message(optional)
processing_ms(optional)
created_at
Use Cases:

debug OCR failures

monitor reliability

